files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%94%9F%E7%89%A9%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#CD7F32"><strong>生物学家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：生物性、活物、基因、动物、植物、细菌</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1562">SCP-CN-1562</a></span></p> </div> <br /> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E5%8C%96%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#CD7F32"><strong>化学家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：化学性、腐蚀性、气体</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1854">SCP-CN-1854</a></span></p> </div> <br /> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E7%89%A9%E7%90%86%E5%AD%A6%E8%80%85.png" class="image" /></div> <p><span style="font-size:120%;"><span style="color:#CD7F32"><strong>物理学家</strong></span></span><br /> <span style="font-size:85%;"><strong>发布一篇评分20以上的、包含下列任一标签的SCP文档：反物理定律、反熵、电力、磁性、重力影响</strong> <a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-cn-1278">SCP-CN-1278</a></span></p> </div> <br /> <div class="left-grid"> <div class="image-container floatleft"><img src="http://scp-jp.wdfiles.com/local--files/hal-aki-achievement-badges/%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%82%81%E3%81%A1%E3%82%83%E3%82%81%E3%81%A1%E3%82%83%E3%81%84%E3%82%B1%E3%83%86%E3%83%AB.png" width="50" alt="%E5%AE%9F%E7%B8%BE_%E3%82%81%E3%81%A1%E3%82%83%E3%82%81%E3%81%A1%E3%82%83%E3%81%84%E3%82%B1%E3%