P-294-JP</a></td> <td>古加乃木</td> <td>古加乃木</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nanimono-demonai" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1703549&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="Nanimono Demonai" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1703549)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nanimono-demonai" >Nanimono Demonai</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>这生造字不可能有读音的吧……不过他们做这个原本的目的是为了什么，难道说是传送？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1637-jp">SCP-1637-JP</a></td> <td>産声は腹の中で</td> <td>产声在腹中</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chabuti" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3009239&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="Chabuti" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3009239)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/chabuti" >Chabuti</a></span><br /> 原案：<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3461191&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="indonootoko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3461191)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" >indonootoko</a></span></td> <td>石榴俱乐部<br /> 阴阳反转教</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>石榴俱乐部是第二次见了。<br /> 现在关于这个组织的情报也开始多了起来，是个吃人的团体？呃……本能上我有些排斥。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1822-jp">SCP-1822-JP</a></td> <td>原始の島</td> <td>原始之岛</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/monidrake" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2781073&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="Monidrake" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2781073)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/monidrake" >Monidrake</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>企划部与开发部之间无休无止的战争。<br /> 感觉有些累了，先去休息吧。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-361-jp">SCP-361-JP</a></td> <td>知らぬが凪</td> <td>未知的凪</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fusinohito" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4900904&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="fusinohito" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4900904)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fusinohito" >fusinohito</a></span><br /> <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yzkrt" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3205804&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="yzkrt" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3205804)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/yzkrt" >yzkrt</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>休息的也差不多了……<br /> 能改造成这样并不是让我吃惊的点，我吃惊的事情是这些家伙居然会在海底也有研究设施。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-391-jp">SCP-391-JP</a></td> <td>ウーパールーパー</td> <td>美西螈</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ak1-yorunaga" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1745066&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="ak1-yorunaga" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1745066)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ak1-yorunaga" >ak1-yorunaga</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>那个记者一定是被人灭口了……日创做的吗？还是别的什么组织做的？他到底得到了什么风声？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-591-jp">SCP-591-JP</a></td> <td>爆ックソ踏ント</td> <td>踩到了会炸的粪便</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/new-wave" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3688222&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="New_wave" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3688222)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/new-wave" >New_wave</a></span></td> <td>负号部队</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>负号部队的守备范围超乎我想象地广……这种不择手段的存在，何等的可怕啊。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-592-jp">SCP-592-JP</a></td> <td>穀潰し</td> <td>吃闲饭</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ripeya" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1971450&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="ripeya-" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1971450)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ripeya" >ripeya-</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>我推测这应该是通过摄食而制造建材的动物，毒性这一点应该是他们的疏漏。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-857-jp">SCP-857-JP</a></td> <td>ヤギは盲目</td> <td>盲目的山羊</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hey-kounoike" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2094799&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="hey_kounoike" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2094799)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hey-kounoike" >hey_kounoike</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>孤独的话死就好了吗，嗯？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-978-jp">SCP-978-JP</a></td> <td>運び屋</td> <td>搬运工</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/k-u-m-a" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1886872&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="k_u_m_a" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1886872)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/k-u-m-a" >k_u_m_a</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>人肉炸弹……说起来日创这是接了什么组织的订单啊，难道是恐怖分子？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1465-jp">SCP-1465-JP</a></td> <td>銭と蟻</td> <td>钱与蚁</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3461191&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="indonootoko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3461191)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" >indonootoko</a></span></td> <td>JAGPATO</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>冻雾，又是冻雾……他怕不是把这个当成了他的实验体仓库哟（笑）时间线上这个应该在报告书之前吧。<br /> 这帮贪污的混蛋也够该死的……这不就是把最基本的权利剥夺了吗？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1527-jp">SCP-1527-JP</a></td> <td>委託のフレーバー</td> <td>托付的香料</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hyoroika09" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3406303&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="hyoroika09" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3406303)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/hyoroika09" >hyoroika09</a></span></td> <td>Are We Cool Yet?</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>我接触到的第一个和AWCY有关的日创项目。<br /> 真是异术家<sup class="footnoteref"><a id="footnoteref-592757-1" href="javascript:;" class="footnoteref" >1</a></sup>也不好当呀！（笑）</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1318-jp">SCP-1318-JP</a></td> <td>マーメイド・アニサキス</td> <td>人鱼异尖线虫</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/amadai" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2768562&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="AMADAI" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2768562)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/amadai" >AMADAI</a></span></td> <td>梦见科技</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>梦见科技，我以前没有见过这个GoI……调查进行了快四个月，很多之前没听过的组织都渐渐浮出水面来了，是这样吗……</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1333-jp">SCP-1333-JP</a></td> <td>いびき消し薬</td> <td>打鼾消除药</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/noyama" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3346860&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="noyama" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3346860)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/noyama" >noyama</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>我从来没听说过打呼噜还能招来虫子。<br /> 不过，雇这个人作为基金会的特工，也许是个好主意……</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1590-jp">SCP-1590-JP</a></td> <td>フェアトレードコーヒー</td> <td>公平贸易咖啡</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3461191&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="indonootoko" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3461191)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/indonootoko" >indonootoko</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>这已经是第几个涉及冻雾的项目了？时间线上没有的东西也开始出现了，到底该怎么修改……</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1964-jp">SCP-1964-JP</a></td> <td>かえるの歌が聞こえてくるよ</td> <td>听得到青蛙唱歌哦</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karatema" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3345869&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="Karatema" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3345869)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/karatema" >Karatema</a></span></td> <td>东弊重工</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>东弊的东西应该没问题，日创的似乎也……不过这两个加一起就不能叫没问题了。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1806-jp">SCP-1806-JP</a></td> <td>勅瀬研究員の受難</td> <td>敕濑研究员的受难</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/atrs-lg" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2788230&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="atrs_lg" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2788230)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/atrs-lg" >atrs_lg</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>忽然想到了《庄子》里面写的：“嗟乎！夫造物者又将以予为此拘拘也。”<br /> 当然了这帮家伙可不能叫做造物者。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1919-jp">SCP-1919-JP</a></td> <td>下品なジョーロ</td> <td>低劣的喷壶</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soya-one" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2577572&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="SOYA_one" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2577572)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/soya-one" >SOYA_one</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>好心办坏事还害死了自己的村民，简直没有什么比这种事情更伤一个老人的心了……这群[脏话删除]混蛋难道不是拿他们做实验体了吗？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1979-jp">SCP-1979-JP</a></td> <td>たけのこの山</td> <td>竹笋山</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wagnascousin" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3389120&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="WagnasCousin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3389120)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wagnascousin" >WagnasCousin</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>这个……很想看看他们说的“更花哨的玩意”是什么。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1033-jp">SCP-1033-JP</a></td> <td>ヴァーチュアル・ラビット</td> <td>虚拟兔子</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/furabbit" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3198079&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="furabbit" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3198079)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/furabbit" >furabbit</a></span></td> <td>imaginanimal</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>这里面的那起事件虽然说闹了大半天，不过似乎结局倒是兔八哥式的结尾……虽然说假如当事人是个小孩子会更完美一些。<br /> 哦，我觉得他大概也忘了那天是他的生日。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1060-jp">SCP-1060-JP</a></td> <td>トーローカマキリ</td> <td>莫名之螳</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/regifu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2979568&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="regifu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2979568)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/regifu" >regifu</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>我可不觉得看着别人死有多好笑。<br /> 另外是什么俗语啊，螳臂当车吗？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1259-jp">SCP-1259-JP</a></td> <td>地獄の沙汰も金次第</td> <td>有钱能使鬼推磨</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/o-92-mallet" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3129932&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="O-92_Mallet" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3129932)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/o-92-mallet" >O-92_Mallet</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>日创一不小心又（？）把世界毁灭了。以货币为食吗……看样子那会引发很糟糕的事情啊。<br /> 另外这里提到日创被暴徒袭击而毁灭了……看起来……</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1297-jp">SCP-1297-JP</a></td> <td>無き者に祈れど届かない</td> <td>向故去的人传不了祈祷的念</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/morelike" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=5252746&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="Morelike " style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=5252746)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/morelike" >Morelike</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>从日创的记录来看，似乎是被他们复活的古代生物的样子。<br /> 这要我以后怎么直视摆放在事故现场的花啊……</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1321-jp">SCP-1321-JP</a></td> <td>後悔の味</td> <td>后悔的味道</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/videogamemonkeymono" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4549537&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="VideoGameMonkeyMONO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4549537)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/videogamemonkeymono" >VideoGameMonkeyMONO</a></span></td> <td>石榴俱乐部<br /> 弟弟的食品店</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>日创似乎受骗了……<br /> 另外“弟弟的食品店”这个GoI又是哪里来的？？</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1429-jp">SCP-1429-JP</a></td> <td>現実改変虫大量発生中</td> <td>本质促动虫正在大量产生</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fattyacid" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2081491&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="FattyAcid" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2081491)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/fattyacid" >FattyAcid</a></span></td> <td>东弊重工</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>结果还是顾头不顾尾……补救措施起码也完备些啊。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1556-jp">SCP-1556-JP</a></td> <td>ココロテン™</td> <td>心脂™</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/regifu" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2979568&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="regifu" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2979568)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/regifu" >regifu</a></span></td> <td>Wondertainment博士</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>那个事件……总感觉像是小说里写某人死后回到熟悉的地方去看看什么的。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1577-jp">SCP-1577-JP</a></td> <td>あまりにもお腹が空いてしまったので、牛は牧草に横たわってしまった</td> <td>因为实在太饿，牛躺在牧草上了</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kankan" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2859452&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="KanKan" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2859452)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/kankan" >KanKan</a></span></td> <td>-</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>一头“吃”“草”的“牛”。<br /> （应该有人明白我的意思吧……）</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/scp-1623-jp">SCP-1623-JP</a></td> <td>goat escape</td> <td>goat escape</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/denkiyacre" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3029673&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="DENKIYACre" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3029673)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/denkiyacre" >DENKIYACre</a></span></td> <td>MC&amp;D</td> </tr> <tr> <td colspan="5"><em>日创的人一般不会对自己的身体做改造，但是如果改造的对象不是自己呢……<br /> 似乎这个东西也不只是能让人逃脱这么简单。</em></td> </tr> <tr> <td><a href="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/old:scp-1735-jp">SCP-1735-JP（旧）</a></td> <td>交わり伝う変態</td> <td>由性交传染的变态</td> <td><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mitan" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=4589204&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1608753667" alt="Mitan" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=4589